Turns on auto print mode. All following display lines print when you
move the cursor off the line using a line feed, form feed, vertical tab,
or auto wrap. The printed line ends with a carriage return adn the
character (LF, FF, or VT) which moved the cursor off the previous line.
Auto wrap lines end with a line feed.
